{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026IKbYfYo4nv1792664477.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>21年前執勤時遇襲癱瘓、上月離世的警員朱振國，明天以警隊最高榮譽舉殯。</p><p></p><p>儀式在紅磡世界殯儀館舉行，靈堂掛上「浩氣長存」橫幅。</p><p></p><p>行政長官李家超、全國政協副主席、前特首梁振英都有致送花牌，保安局局長鄧炳強、警務處處長周一鳴到場致意，現任警隊高層、警務處前處長蕭澤頤亦陸續到場。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FUNERAL-1730.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20267cDloimSXn1792664503.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>2005年朱振國執勤期間，被一名青年拔刀割傷頸部，因大量失血令腦部缺氧致全身癱瘓，上月中因器官衰竭在廣華醫院離世，終年52歲。明天辭靈後，靈柩會移送長沙灣警署舉行道別儀式，然後安葬浩園。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:05.010834+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":230,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T09:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:58:04.726646+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:46:46.114863+00:00","content_hash":"c23a9392b1ad206fc87f3edf85f59b8e8d7baf9b544e0f1ffffceef0eaec2789","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:05.010834+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}